nx-redux: mupen64plus core netplay in the libretro core (spike, issue #149).
Built with NX_NETPLAY=1 (+ static SDL2_net); the session comes from the
NX_M64P_NETPLAY_HOST/PORT/PLAYER environment, set by the pak launcher after
the pre-launch wizard, and talks to our m64p-server.elf like the standalone.
Upstream never compiles netplay.c: it lacked the log_cb declaration, and a
self-stopped emulator fell off the libco thread (crash): it now asks the
frontend to shut down. NX_M64P_NETPLAY_DEBUG=1 logs every seat key change.

